---
const appName = '纸小记';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hans">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>{appName} 协议 | 启枢科技</title>
		<meta name="description" content="纸小记用户服务协议与隐私政策。" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/logo-light.png" type="image/png" />
		<style>
			body {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
				color: #07142f;
				background:
					linear-gradient(rgba(36, 174, 226, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
					linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(36, 174, 226, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
					linear-gradient(135deg, #fff8ff 0%, #eefaff 55%, #f7fbff 100%);
				background-size: 28px 28px, 28px 28px, auto;
			}

			main {
				width: min(920px, calc(100% - 32px));
				margin: 76px auto;
			}

			a {
				color: inherit;
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			h1 {
				margin: 0 0 18px;
				font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 88px);
				line-height: 0.98;
				color: #42bdeb;
				text-shadow: 4px 5px 0 #f3cf3d, 8px 9px 0 #081431;
			}

			p {
				max-width: 680px;
				color: #4c5870;
				font-size: 18px;
				font-weight: 600;
				line-height: 1.75;
			}

			.actions {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
				gap: 18px;
				margin-top: 38px;
			}

			.actions a {
				padding: 28px;
				border: 2px solid rgba(36, 174, 226, 0.32);
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
				box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 rgba(36, 174, 226, 0.12);
				font-size: 22px;
				font-weight: 900;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>{appName}</h1>
			<p>这里放置纸小记当前版本的用户服务协议和隐私政策。后续若新增儿童隐私、第三方 SDK 清单或账号注销说明，也可以继续放在同一应用目录下。</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a href="/zh-hans/legal/zhixiaoji/terms/">用户服务协议</a>
				<a href="/zh-hans/legal/zhixiaoji/privacy/">隐私政策</a>
				<a href="/zh-hans/legal/">返回协议中心</a>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
